# ROOFCAT: the town is busy from the start and gets busier area by area, as
# Ninpek does ("the enemies come at you fast, in great numbers"). Riding the
# whole first loop without a hit or a throw (nothing can take a life here),
# the average number of foes awake on screen rises in every area (in tenths:
# at least 4, 5.5, 7 and 8, against about 2.4 falling to 1.7 before). The bonus
# stretches are left out of the count.
game roofcat
wait 20
press A
wait 75
cheat godmode
waituntil in_arena == 1 40000
expect density0 >= 40
expect density1 >= 55
expect density2 >= 70
expect density3 >= 80
